+        "positions.  It symbolically denotes the full HIST whose core path visits "
+        "start XOR P_sigma(i) for i=0,...,2^n-1 and that contains every forced "
+        "pendant edge.  Exactly n integers in 0..n-1 are permitted."
+    ),
