+| Preset | Seed | Model | Result | Exact grader result |
+|---|---:|---|---|---|
+| easy | 1807830277 | Gemini 3.8 Flash | solved | `ok` |
+| easy | 632277673 | GPT-5.6 Terra | solved | `ok` |
